{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalValue","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLAccidentalValueO","text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of this element."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentaltext\/value"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalText"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL17MXLAccidentalTextV5valueAA0C5ValueOvp","role":"symbol","title":"value","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"value"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLAccidentalValueO","text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"symbolKind":"property"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalText\/value","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidentalText":{"type":"topic","title":"MXLAccidentalText","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalText","abstract":[{"text":"The accidental-text type represents an element with an accidental value and text-formatting attributes.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLAccidentalText"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLAccidentalText"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentaltext"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidentalValue":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The accidental-value type represents notated accidentals supported by MusicXML. In the MusicXML 2.0 DTD this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was a string with values that could be included. The XSD strengthens the data typing to an enumerated list."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The quarter- and three-quarters- accidentals are Tartini-style quarter-tone accidentals. The -down and -up"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accidentals are quarter-tone accidentals that include arrows pointing down or up. The slash- accidentals are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used in Turkish classical music. The numbered sharp and flat accidentals are superscripted versions of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accidental signs, used in Turkish folk music. The sori and koron accidentals are microtonal sharp and flat"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accidentals used in Iranian and Persian music. The other accidental covers accidentals other than those listed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"here. It is usually used in combination with the smufl attribute to specify a particular SMuFL accidental. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"smufl attribute may be used with any accidental value to help specify the appearance of symbols that share the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same MusicXML semantics."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentalvalue","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLAccidentalValue"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MXLAccidentalValue","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLAccidentalValue"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalValue","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidentalText/value":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of this element."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"value","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentaltext\/value","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalText\/value","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLAccidentalValue","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLAccidentalValueO","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}}}